#70103
"Path Near a Broken Abbey"
"The path follows alongside a large, red sandstone abbey on the western side. 
Thick trees block the eastern side of the path.  The glass of a window, too
high to reach, is broken in several panes, the holes strung with web.  The
branches overhead reach across the path, right up to the sandstone wall, every
branch entangled with webs.  The trees crowd so close around the path leading
south that, though there is just enough room to pass now, with a few more
years of growth it will be impossible.
"
""
