#70106
"In the Ruined Abbey"
"In addition to the broken rubble that fills the area, a large, partially
destroyed table sits in the center of this room.  Many shattered and
splintered wooden chairs lie strewn about, and mangled pieces of silverware
are scattered amongst the rest of the debris.  On the eastern and southern
walls, several small windows have all been destroyed to varying degrees, and
it is virtually impossible to see much of the outside world.
"
