"large destroyed table"
"The table might have once hoasted fine feasts for over a dozen people, but now
it is not fit to serve any.  The wood has split entirely across the middle and
the two sides have caved in towards each other.  It's legs may have featured
ornate carving, but now most of that is blackened by a small fire that didn't
last long enough to finish it's destruction.  The polished surface has be
scraped raw and is completely useless now.
"
E
"small window"
"Broken glass still clings to some of the window panes but is all opaque due to
the dirt and ash covering it.  The very little you can see outside the abbey
is blocked by thick growth right up against the wall.
"
